<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA - WEATHER - MAY 29-JUNE 1.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA - WEATHER - MAY 29-JUNE 1.</headline>
<text>
<p>THURSDAY</p>
<p>- Cold, unstable weather with heavy rainfalls across the country. Sleet and snow in the mountains. Windy in the southern regions. Temp 2 to 18 C.</p>
<p>FRIDAY, SAUTRDAY, SUNDAY</p>
<p>- Weather conditions remain unchanged for the weekend. The rain area covers the entire country with winds in the east and southeast. Snowy in the mountains. Temp. 2 to 18. (Source: National Meteorological Institute)</p>
